WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.164
"I got rid of all the nuts," Rex said.

2
00:00:10.165 --> 00:00:17.872
"Now there's a new pile!"

3
00:00:17.873 --> 00:00:20.219
Tor put down her bag.

4
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.612
"Let's clean them up again," she said.

5
00:00:24.613 --> 00:00:29.465
The buddies picked up the nuts.

6
00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:37.505
They threw them behind a rock.

7
00:00:37.506 --> 00:00:41.216
Tor went to get her bag.

8
00:00:41.217 --> 00:00:48.556
She gasped. "My bag is gone!"

9
00:00:48.557 --> 00:00:52.405
"Where did you leave it?" Sara asked.

10
00:00:52.406 --> 00:00:55.874
Tor scratched her head.

11
00:00:55.875 --> 00:01:04.461
"I thought I left it here," she said.

12
00:01:04.462 --> 00:01:11.090
The buddies looked for Tor's bag.

13
00:01:11.091 --> 00:01:16.721
Sid looked under a log.

14
00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:23.132
Rex looked behind a bush.

15
00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:25.662
"The stream!" Sara said.

16
00:01:25.663 --> 00:01:33.583
"Maybe you left your bag there."

17
00:01:33.584 --> 00:01:37.805
Everyone went to the stream.

18
00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:51.360
The bag wasn't there.

19
00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:54.559
They returned to their spot.

20
00:01:54.560 --> 00:02:00.013
"Oh! There's my bag," Tor said.

21
00:02:00.014 --> 00:02:07.142
She picked it up.

22
00:02:07.143 --> 00:02:11.751
"Why is it so heavy?" Tor asked.

23
00:02:11.752 --> 00:02:13.512
She looked inside.

24
00:02:13.513 --> 00:02:20.114
"Nuts!"

